# Fictional mail in production chat UI. No runner, account, prompt or actual send.
fold open
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es mail pending
expect Fictional update 4
shot mail-pending-unfolded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es mail bundled
expect 4 messages bundled
expect Combined handoff complete.
absent Delivered in the bundled agent handoff.
absent Legacy update
shot mail-bundled-unfolded
fold folded
expect 4 messages bundled
expect Combined handoff complete.
absent Delivered in the bundled agent handoff.
shot mail-bundled-cover
[phone] After promotion, open Phone B's existing history and confirm the old repeated delivery notices are gone; observe one normal handoff replacing its pending rows.
